OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm and
OL,6,Fmostly dry evening, but a few showers
OL,7,Fare possible, mainly in the west.
OL,8,FStaying similar overnight with clear
OL,9,Fspells. Cloud and scattered showers
OL,10,Farriving in the west later. Warmer and
OL,11,Fmuch more humid compared to last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FCloudier and more humid than
OL,14,Fon Monday with a chance of showers,
OL,15,Fthese locally heavy and thundery but
OL,16,Fmany places remaining dry. Sunny
OL,17,Fspells developing and feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
